{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Coldest Winter&quot;</strong> is a mature psychological horror story that promises a haunting adventure, icy landscapes, and difficult decisions. Throughout the journey, you will play as Jovanna Pe\u00f1a, a hardened New Yorker who is dealing with the coldest winter she has ever experienced. You will encounter an unhinged group of characters, and together you will try to survive the unrelenting cold and unravel the chilling truth behind this unnatural weather.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/d7184f42aa88802a99cca834d0388d94.poster.avif?t=1758260946\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/d7184f42aa88802a99cca834d0388d94.webm?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/d7184f42aa88802a99cca834d0388d94.mp4?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative Kaleidoscope</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a mature, adaptive narrative that challenges your emotions, fears, and morals to uncover a terrifying secret. Featuring multiple thematic branches that alter the themes, tone, pacing, and narrative structure to reflect the parts you resonate most with.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/4f8897370f175a3b488760ea0baac093.poster.avif?t=1758260946\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/4f8897370f175a3b488760ea0baac093.webm?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/4f8897370f175a3b488760ea0baac093.mp4?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Kit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the necessary tools, equipment, and gear to prepare yourself for harsh weather and dangerous encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/ff6255e1af09c8185c28c8ba79ab1031.poster.avif?t=1758260946\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/ff6255e1af09c8185c28c8ba79ab1031.webm?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/ff6255e1af09c8185c28c8ba79ab1031.mp4?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feel the Struggle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an innovative choice-based gameplay mechanic that simulates the weight of real-world decision-making. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/dba3d85ffe9d6869596c514a75e30369.poster.avif?t=1758260946\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/dba3d85ffe9d6869596c514a75e30369.webm?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/dba3d85ffe9d6869596c514a75e30369.mp4?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Nueva York</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Coldest Winter explores a different side of New York, featuring a captivating blend of bold original artwork and Latin-inspired music from cultures all over the city.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/7ecf2565b320d9df110da9423aa666a0.poster.avif?t=1758260946\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/7ecf2565b320d9df110da9423aa666a0.webm?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/extras/7ecf2565b320d9df110da9423aa666a0.mp4?t=1758260946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO OUT NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check it out demo for yourself today! We want to make the game even better, so let us know your thoughts too! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2627420?t=1758260946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758260946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758260946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758260946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3794470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Coldest Winter&quot;</strong> is a mature psychological horror story that promises a haunting adventure, icy landscapes, and difficult decisions. Throughout the journey, you will play as Jovanna Pe\u00f1a, a hardened New Yorker who is dealing wit